[I] Emoji codes and conversions for Python

[T] emoji is a Python library for converting between emoji characters and
[T] their text names. It supports the entire set of emoji codes defined by
[T] the Unicode consortium plus many aliases, and can also find and count
[T] emoji in strings.

[U] https://pypi.org/project/emoji/

